        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 88TB12, 88 Solid Brass 12\" Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe modern feel of this Deltana 88TB12 towel bar makes it great for any contemporary setting. It is small enough for cramped bathrooms and the 12 inch length means that it will not overwhelming in the kitchen for hand towels. Made out of solid brass, it is available in polished chrome and satin nickel finishes. This 88 series towel bar is made with the excellent quality for which Deltana is known.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88TB12-specifications.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"216\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 88TB12 12\" Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/18-inch-88-series-towel-bar-deltana-88tb18\"><b>18\" 88 Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-88-series-towel-bar-deltana-88tb24\"><b>24\" 88 Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 88 Series\"><b>Deltana 88 Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 88 Solid Brass 12 Inch Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Length: 13-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 14-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection From Wall to Bar: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88TB12.pdf?v=1691095356\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 88TB12 12\" Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
